	// `mode=manual`: `certificateChain` and `privateKey` are required.
	//
	// For `agent`, the supplied chain must contain a certificate whose SPKI
	// hash is the current trust anchor (or the prepared one, see
	// `POST /settings/tls/agent/anchor`); otherwise the request fails with
	// `409` and code `anchor_mismatch`, because enrolled agents would stop
	// trusting the server.
